{"resourceIdentifier":"3069","resourceName":"Tangyin County MSW Landfill Site LFG Pollution Control and Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Tangyin County MSW Landfill Site LFG Pollution Control and Comprehensive Utilization Project  is located at Tangyin MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as the Tangyin landfill site), in Tangyin County, Henan Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Tangyin County BCCY New Energy CO., Ltd.\r\nThe project started to construct on 22/10/2021.The project has a total designed capacity 2MW (2*1MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 93,149 MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 48,994tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 489,940tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":35.905830,"longitude":114.551743},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-07-12","endExclusive":"2022-08-12","endInclusive":"2022-08-11"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3069"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3069"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"48994"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values